Modified by the jabar authors to run on Bazel 9. Every change is marked
`JABAR:` in the file and enumerated in its header docstring. In summary:
JavaInfo is loaded from rules_java rather than taken as a Starlark global;
aspect implementations return a provider list rather than a struct;
javac_options is read as a depset; struct.to_json() is replaced with
json.encode(); and javac options, which Bazel 9 emits as one shell-quoted
string, are split respecting quotes.
